{"assets":["/statement-assets/0532f022b4dcd8b58bcf6502a2c3cd0306c8740d9b16445c8219dd38b7047a8c.png","/statement-assets/54a37b09f294f9080e911432a1b8c997b0c6b39cec97630f1cfc74d1e7a08f05.png","/statement-assets/bdbf5f704c8457241dd67978d7eb94c2008a2799eac4581da7af2ebc68c22ec1.png","/statement-assets/abe9d7aa2696ab93944cf4f85b550e04859f6f9309550680219cc6ca879f3cba.png","/statement-assets/da5af59eb8515c2a3d67fe6a04cd22c62aeb14f030959d4bb44f5ee93f993728.png","/statement-assets/3d6031912a969af4cd956c95a891d5b6e5d9aea48501acad934f0fd9c5760931.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"540","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Combination Lock"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Scrooge McDuck keeps his most treasured savings in a home safe with a combination lock. Each time he wants to put there the treasures that he's earned fair and square, he has to open the lock."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/0532f022b4dcd8b58bcf6502a2c3cd0306c8740d9b16445c8219dd38b7047a8c.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The combination lock is represented by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" rotating disks with digits from 0 to 9 written on them. Scrooge McDuck has to turn some disks so that the combination of digits on the disks forms a secret combination. In one move, he can rotate one disk one digit forwards or backwards. In particular, in one move he can go from digit 0 to digit 9 and vice versa. What minimum number of actions does he need for that?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of disks on the combination lock."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a string of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" digits — the original state of the disks."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains a string of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" digits — Scrooge McDuck's combination that opens the lock."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the minimum number of moves Scrooge McDuck needs to open the lock."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n82195\n64723\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"13\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","tex